  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「早川さん……？　駄目、雨のなかを走ったら！　滑って、転んじゃう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「時国先輩。初めて出会ったころ、先輩には他に目的があったのだとしても。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「ただ騙して、利用しただけだとしても。あたしが救われたのは、『ほんと』です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「先輩が、ほんとに怪しげでオカルト的な魔法みたいなのを使えないかぎりは……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「あたしの心のなかで、ずっとずうっとそれは『嘘』にはならないですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「早川さん……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あぁ、行っちゃう。お、追いかけなくちゃ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……あなたは、先に帰っていてもいい。これ以上、迷惑はかけられない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あなたはきっと、『助けるひと』だけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「全員を助けるのは、みんなの重荷をすべて背負うのは、人間には不可能。見て、いられないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしは、あなたよりお姉さんだから。自分のことは、自分で片をつける」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……わわっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「手ぇ、引っぱらないで！　『急いで追いかけよう』って？　ひとの話、聞いてた？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どうして、こんなことをするの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしの心をすこしだけ救ってくれた、優しいあなたには……。傷ついてほしくない、危ないことをしてほしくない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしに関わってほしくない、迷惑をかけるだけだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「それなのに……。どうして、あなたはわたしの手を握ってしまうの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「もう、いい。あなたは、そういうひと……。でもいつか、後悔する。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしと一緒に歩いていたら、行き着く先は地獄しかない。それでも、いい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……そう。あなたは、そうなんだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「あぁ……。だから、あなたは。だから、伯父さんも」"
  },
